WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.180
Could an ordinary workday become part

2
00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:06.940
of something you never expected?

3
00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:08.700
In Acts eighteen,

4
00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:11.440
Paul meets Priscilla and Aquila in Corinth.

5
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:12.960
They share a trade:

6
00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:13.960
tentmaking.

7
00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:16.100
He stays with them and works.

8
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:17.700
Years later,

9
00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:18.760
writing to Rome,

10
00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:21.060
Paul greets them as fellow workers

11
00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:22.220
in Christ Jesus.

12
00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:24.320
A church meets in their house.

13
00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:26.720
That shared work became part

14
00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:28.640
of a lasting gospel partnership.

15
00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:31.600
Their story lets us glimpse God’s wisdom

16
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.000
in bringing people together.

17
00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:35.840
We cannot predict what every encounter will

18
00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:36.260
become.

19
00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:38.440
But we can be faithful to God

20
00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:40.340
with the people already near us.

21
00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:41.580
At work today,

22
00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:43.780
make room for a real conversation.

23
00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:45.220
Learn a name.

24
00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:46.600
Listen carefully.
